## 5. Discipline that still applies

- **Evidence tags and precedence are unchanged** — the closed set and the T1 measured > T2
  stated > T3 secondary rule, per `_FINDING_STANDARD.md`. Conflicts are superseded, never
  deleted; log them in `_pm/source_precedence_and_conflict_register.md`.
- **`[⚠VERIFY]` gates the output.** An unsourceable claim is either closed with a citation or
  cut — it never ships as an assertion.
- **Never cite across the `_sources/` boundary.** `engagement/` material stays out of any bid.
- **Review before it ships** — `panel-review` if the Panel Framework is installed, else a manual
  multi-lens pass.
